OL,3,AKenyan doomsday cult leader given life
OL,4,Asentence for murdering 191 people
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kenyan court has sentenced the leader
OL,7,Fof a doomsday cult, Paul Mackenzie, to
OL,8,F200 years in prison for murdering 191
OL,9,Fpeople, all but one of them children.
OL,11,FAlongside 27 others, Mackenzie was
OL,12,Ffound guilty of the murders for
OL,13,Finstructing members of his cult to
OL,14,Fstarve their children to death so they
OL,15,Fcould "meet Jesus".
OL,17,FJustice Diana Mochache said Mackenzie
OL,18,Fbore the "primary criminal culpability"
OL,19,Ffor ordering his followers to fast to
OL,20,Fdeath, in one of Kenya's deadliest
OL,21,Fepisodes of religious extremism.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
