OL,3,AKenyan doomsday cult leader given life
OL,4,Asentence for murdering 191 people
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The sentence is appropriate and just,
OL,7,Fto send an unmistakable message that
OL,8,Fsuch atrocities warrant the maximum
OL,9,Fpenalties allowed by law," the judge
OL,10,Fadded.
